{"attack":"操纵对手的持有物进行攻击。当对手没有携带道具时，使出此招式时便会失败。","description":"探知目标道具进行攻击，该效果不会消耗目标的道具。\n如果目标没有携带道具，或者特性为笨拙时，招式使用失败。\n\n该招式对无法移除的道具（如苍响携带的腐朽的剑）同样有效。\n若对手携带的道具因本次攻击而触发，如佛柑果、逃脱按键、弱点保险，招式仍然使用成功；若道具触发时机更早，则使用失败。\n在魔法空间下，该招式对携带道具的目标依然有效。\n使用招式后的提示为：“对手的 [宝可梦的名字] 被 [对手宝可梦的道具] 袭击了！”","levelUpMoves":[],"tutorMoves":["Gastly","Haunter","Gengar","Marowak form:alolan","Mew","Shedinja","Sableye","Duskull","Dusclops","Spiritomb","Dusknoir","Froslass","Rotom","Rotom form:heat","Rotom form:wash","Rotom form:frost","Rotom form:fan","Rotom form:mow","Giratina form:altered","Giratina form:origin","Yamask","Yamask form:galarian","Cofagrigus","Frillish","Jellicent","Litwick","Lampent","Chandelure","Golett","Golurk","Phantump","Trevenant","Pumpkaboo","Gourgeist","Decidueye","Sandygast","Palossand","Dhelmise","Lunala","Lunala form:fullmoon","Marshadow","Marshadow form:zenith","Sinistea form:phony","Sinistea form:antique","Polteageist form:phony","Polteageist form:antique","Cursola","Runerigus"],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":[],"tmMoves9":["Gastly","Haunter","Gengar","Mew","Typhlosion","Typhlosion form:hisuian","Misdreavus","Sableye","Shuppet","Banette","Duskull","Dusclops","Mismagius","Spiritomb","Dusknoir","Froslass","Zoroark form:hisuian","Litwick","Lampent","Chandelure","Golett","Golurk","Phantump","Trevenant","Decidueye","Sandygast","Palossand","Spectrier","Skeledirge","Ceruledge","Bramblin","Brambleghast","Rabsca","Greavard","Houndstone","FlutterMane","Gholdengo","Poltchageist form:counterfeit","Poltchageist form:artisan","Sinistcha form:unremarkable","Sinistcha form:masterpiece","Munkidori"],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}